abstract: >-
  Complete research-support software and mixed-license derived data for action
  sufficiency and update risk in rolling storage optimization. The package
  combines unchanged core Australian inputs and reference outputs with
  separately manifested v14 pilot, v15 statistics/theory/parameter checks and
  v16 six-figure redrawing code. It retains the failed-compression boundary,
  exploratory design and conditional inference. Fresh limited package checks
  do not establish independent external replication of the entire study.
  Original code is MIT licensed; source data and copied QA code retain separate
  provider/third-party terms. IESO source prices and proprietary fonts are not
  redistributed. The author will add the actual Zenodo version DOI after deposit.
